  m_Name: GoodLife
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EndingData
  endingType: 0
  title: A Small Survival
  description: 'You survived until the end.

    

    The city was still far from
    perfect, but the sea slowly began to recover its color.

    Your small choices
    remained here as quiet traces of change.

    

    Tomorrow can still come.

    For
    now, that is enough.'
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
